ATTRIBUTION NOTE

This project includes a digital reproduction of "The Merry Violinist with a
Glass of Wine" (c. 1623) by Gerrit van Honthorst, currently held by the
Thyssen-Bornemisza Museum, Madrid. The work is in the public domain (the
artist died in 1656, placing the painting well beyond any copyright term).
The image was sourced from Wikimedia Commons and modified (background
removed via OpenCV GrabCut segmentation) for use in this project.

The MIT license above applies to the code in this repository. The painting
itself is public domain and may be used freely.
